WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.461 --> 00:00:01.984
- You will always be able to make

00:00:01.984 --> 00:00:04.010
money if your brand is strong.

00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:07.926
A lot of you will block your own success.

00:00:07.926 --> 00:00:12.186
Because you're fearful of
what's going to happen.

00:00:12.186 --> 00:00:13.840
I'm a big believer in, if you don't

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:15.675
dream it, you can't become it.

00:00:15.675 --> 00:00:17.596
I promised myself and my parents,

00:00:17.596 --> 00:00:18.951
when I got some money, I would

00:00:18.951 --> 00:00:19.935
know what to do with it.

00:00:19.935 --> 00:00:21.015
And I would take care of it.

00:00:21.015 --> 00:00:22.922
Nah, when you're lined up and trying

00:00:22.922 --> 00:00:24.184
to take something from me, especially

00:00:24.184 --> 00:00:26.790
that championship, I hate you.

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:30.623
Larry, you, (audience laughs)

00:00:31.913 --> 00:00:34.863
you're just what a
basketball player should be.

00:00:34.863 --> 00:00:36.988
- He's an American, retired NBA player

00:00:36.988 --> 00:00:39.593
who played point guard for the LA Lakers.

00:00:39.593 --> 00:00:41.693
He won a championship and a NBA finals

00:00:41.693 --> 00:00:44.752
Most Valuable Player award,
in his rookie season.

00:00:44.752 --> 00:00:46.528
He was rated as the greatest NBA

00:00:46.528 --> 00:00:50.307
point guard of all time, by ESPN, in 2007.

00:00:50.307 --> 00:00:51.293
He's Magic Johnson.

00:00:51.293 --> 00:00:52.877
And here's my take on his Top 10

00:00:52.877 --> 00:00:54.089
Rules for Success.

00:00:54.089 --> 00:00:55.974
Number four is my personal favorite.

00:00:55.974 --> 00:00:57.051
And make sure to stick around

00:00:57.051 --> 00:00:58.025
all the way to the end, for some

00:00:58.025 --> 00:00:59.858
special bonus footage.

00:01:03.159 --> 00:01:05.764
- What do I worry about?

00:01:05.764 --> 00:01:08.097
I worry about brand control.

00:01:09.776 --> 00:01:12.762
My brand is huge now, right?

00:01:12.762 --> 00:01:14.274
And one thing I fight with everyday,

00:01:14.274 --> 00:01:16.719
I want to make sure I
don't dilute the brand.

00:01:16.719 --> 00:01:19.625
I don't do anything,
make any major mistakes.

00:01:19.625 --> 00:01:22.269
Because any mistake will hurt your brand.

00:01:22.269 --> 00:01:23.307
And so those are the things that

00:01:23.307 --> 00:01:24.571
keep me up at night.

00:01:24.571 --> 00:01:27.899
Just making sure my brand remains strong.

00:01:27.899 --> 00:01:30.016
And so that's a good message for all

00:01:30.016 --> 00:01:33.785
these young men and
women watching your show.

00:01:33.785 --> 00:01:36.661
Is make sure that your
brand is everything.

00:01:36.661 --> 00:01:38.894
And you will always be able to make money

00:01:38.894 --> 00:01:40.573
if your brand is strong.

00:01:40.573 --> 00:01:42.966
Even if you go bankrupt.

00:01:42.966 --> 00:01:44.585
If your brand is strong, you'll be able

00:01:44.585 --> 00:01:46.085
to still make some money.

00:01:46.085 --> 00:01:47.358
Donald Trump proved that.

00:01:47.358 --> 00:01:49.631
He bounced right back.

00:01:49.631 --> 00:01:50.972
But look where he is today.

00:01:50.972 --> 00:01:53.938
He went through that
phase, came right back.

00:01:53.938 --> 00:01:55.783
Because he kept the brand strong.

00:01:55.783 --> 00:01:57.617
And that's important.

00:01:57.617 --> 00:02:01.334
(instrumental music)

00:02:01.334 --> 00:02:05.167
- [Announcer] And that's
what he does so well.

00:02:10.488 --> 00:02:13.571
(instrumental music)

00:02:21.753 --> 00:02:25.123
- When I did my research
on starting a business,

00:02:25.123 --> 00:02:27.436
the most important thing you have to do,

00:02:27.436 --> 00:02:29.163
and a lot of you in here, some day

00:02:29.163 --> 00:02:30.996
want to be like Larry.

00:02:32.013 --> 00:02:34.390
And like Mr. Bryn, is that you have

00:02:34.390 --> 00:02:36.807
to first, stop being fearful.

00:02:42.149 --> 00:02:46.205
A lot of you will block your own success.

00:02:46.205 --> 00:02:50.665
Because you're fearful of
what's going to happen.

00:02:50.665 --> 00:02:53.367
Because the comfort zone is here.

00:02:53.367 --> 00:02:55.034
Make a great living.

00:02:56.487 --> 00:02:57.987
My bills are paid.

00:03:00.285 --> 00:03:04.202
Everything is great,
"I'm scared to change."

00:03:04.202 --> 00:03:06.619
so you block your own growth.

00:03:08.407 --> 00:03:10.890
So you have to now say to yourself,

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:13.807
once you get the tools, once you've

00:03:14.648 --> 00:03:17.908
done your homework, then you can

00:03:17.908 --> 00:03:21.213
start making a move to say, "Okay,

00:03:21.213 --> 00:03:23.745
"hey I can be a
businesswoman, a businessman.

00:03:23.745 --> 00:03:25.851
And start my own thing."

00:03:25.851 --> 00:03:28.220
But you got to believe in yourself first.

00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:31.303
