this is unbelievable.

00:03:47.901 --> 00:03:49.914
He's throwing the ball from there.

00:03:49.914 --> 00:03:52.747
He throws it from 10 feet inbound.

00:03:56.177 --> 00:03:57.244
And it went in.

00:03:57.244 --> 00:03:58.777
- I'm a big believer in, if you don't

00:03:58.777 --> 00:04:00.508
dream it you can't become it.

00:04:00.508 --> 00:04:02.885
I mean, look where you're sitting.

00:04:02.885 --> 00:04:04.941
You've done a wonderful job.

00:04:04.941 --> 00:04:08.084
And you remained a good man, with all

00:04:08.084 --> 00:04:09.699
the success that you've had and your

00:04:09.699 --> 00:04:11.156
family has had.

00:04:11.156 --> 00:04:13.571
And just like myself, you had the dream

00:04:13.571 --> 00:04:15.782
that you could be something in life.

00:04:15.782 --> 00:04:16.952
And do something in life.

00:04:16.952 --> 00:04:19.285
And so, I was a big dreamer.

00:04:20.558 --> 00:04:23.996
My job was to clean these seven floors

00:04:23.996 --> 00:04:25.739
between Friday and Sunday.

00:04:25.739 --> 00:04:27.818
So, every time I would go to,

00:04:27.818 --> 00:04:31.439
the seventh floor was the CEO's office.

00:04:31.439 --> 00:04:33.792
So I would bust in like I was the CEO.

00:04:33.792 --> 00:04:36.082
I'm dreaming, like I'm the CEO now.

00:04:36.082 --> 00:04:38.889
And then I would kick
my feet up on his desk,

00:04:38.889 --> 00:04:41.111
recline the seat back.

00:04:41.111 --> 00:04:43.828
And I pretended like I had
an assistant out front.

00:04:43.828 --> 00:04:46.613
And I would hit the intercom button,

00:04:46.613 --> 00:04:48.522
"Tony, could you bring me today's paper?

00:04:48.522 --> 00:04:49.858
"And some coffee and doughnuts?"

00:04:49.858 --> 00:04:51.291
(laughs)

00:04:51.291 --> 00:04:52.642
And so I'd pretend she would come

00:04:52.642 --> 00:04:56.559
into the office and one
time I'm sitting there,

00:04:57.442 --> 00:05:00.132
dreaming, and he walks in on me.

00:05:00.132 --> 00:05:01.859
(laughs)

00:05:01.859 --> 00:05:02.887
And he said, "What are you doing?"

00:05:02.887 --> 00:05:05.332
I said, "Well I'm dreaming
like I'm the CEO."

00:05:05.332 --> 00:05:07.592
And who would have ever thought?

00:05:07.592 --> 00:05:09.075
I've been blessed.

00:05:09.075 --> 00:05:12.014
Here I am, I am the CEO of my own company.

00:05:12.014 --> 00:05:13.681
And what a blessing.

00:05:15.369 --> 00:05:17.863
But I think back to those moments.

00:05:17.863 --> 00:05:19.462
And those moments helped me to get

00:05:19.462 --> 00:05:21.025
to where I am today.

00:05:21.025 --> 00:05:24.108
(instrumental music)

00:05:39.989 --> 00:05:41.419
